                  'Expanded operations to serve clients across 20+ countries worldwide.',
              },
              {
                year: '2019',
                title: 'Innovation Award',
                description:
                  'Recognized for our cutting-edge solutions and technological innovation.',
              },
              {
                year: '2023',
                title: 'New Horizons',
                description:
